1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:09,000
Daniel Price: Good afternoon everyone, thanks for joining the Q3 board update. I'll start with the headline numbers, then Mei will cover finances.

2
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:24,000
Daniel Price: We closed the quarter at four point two million in annual recurring revenue, up eighteen percent from Q2. Net revenue retention was one hundred and twelve percent.

3
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:31,000
Robert Hayes: That's a strong quarter. What drove the retention number?

4
00:00:31,500 --> 00:00:45,000
Daniel Price: Mostly expansion in our mid-market accounts. Teams start with one department and roll out to sales and support within six months.

5
00:00:45,500 --> 00:01:02,000
Mei Lin: On the finance side, gross margin improved to seventy eight percent after we renegotiated our cloud contract. Burn is down to three hundred thousand per month, which gives us twenty six months of runway.

6
00:01:02,500 --> 00:01:12,000
Robert Hayes: Twenty six months is comfortable. Are you planning to raise next year or push toward profitability?

7
00:01:12,500 --> 00:01:27,000
Daniel Price: Our plan is to reach break-even by the end of next year without raising. If growth accelerates, we'd consider a Series B from a position of strength.

8
00:01:27,500 --> 00:01:40,000
Robert Hayes: I'd like to see a scenario model for both paths before the next board meeting. Mei, can you prepare that?

9
00:01:40,500 --> 00:01:48,000
Mei Lin: Yes, I'll prepare a base case and a growth case with hiring plans and share it two weeks before the meeting.

10
00:01:48,500 --> 00:02:03,000
Daniel Price: One risk to flag. Our largest customer, about eight percent of revenue, has a new CIO who is reviewing all vendors.

11
00:02:03,500 --> 00:02:12,000
Robert Hayes: That's a concentration risk. What's the plan to protect that account?

12
00:02:12,500 --> 00:02:25,000
Daniel Price: I'll personally meet their CIO next month, and our customer success team is preparing an ROI report showing hours saved per team.

13
00:02:25,500 --> 00:02:34,000
Robert Hayes: Good. Please send the board a short update after that meeting.

14
00:02:34,500 --> 00:02:42,000
Daniel Price: Will do. That's everything from us. Thank you all for your time.
